  [,] 18:40 20m CFG !zsh prompt ⌇⡪⡯⡵⣇
    * Drop %~ from info — was causing the exact path duplication
    * Move alias check to precmd — nameddirs match is inherently dynamic, can't be static
    * [_] Vendor gitstatus.plugin.zsh — daemon avoids per-prompt git forking entirely
    *   Adopt gitstatusd inotify diffing — incremental status beats repeated git status --porcelain
    *   Consider zsh-async (mafredri) instead — pure-zsh fallback if avoiding daemon dependency
    *   Reference sindresorhus/pure — proven async-callback pattern using zsh-async
    *   Reference agkozak-zsh-prompt — alternate async model, git/venv/vi-mode already integrated
    * [_] Steal instant-prompt cache hook — hides .zshrc/compinit latency, biggest speed win
    * [_] Steal transient-prompt zle-line-finish hook — collapses old lines, cleans scrollback/copy-paste
    * [?] Adopt unique-prefix path truncation — avoids ambiguous identical-looking truncated paths
    * [$] Test WSL2/inotify fallback — confirm gitstatusd works on MINIPC/VD600 branch
    * [$] Keep venv/nested logic unchanged — only splice in git/perf pieces, no rewrite
